00:41:21.320 --> 00:41:22.280
punta ka sa office ko.

00:41:22.880 --> 00:41:23.999
Okay. Salamat, Ginoong Sun.

00:41:24.880 --> 00:41:25.679
Bilisan mo kumain.

00:41:43.280 --> 00:41:44.559
Hello, Meiqi?

00:41:48.320 --> 00:41:49.280
Kumakain ako ngayon.

00:41:49.280 --> 00:41:50.159
Sa canteen ng school.

00:41:51.159 --> 00:41:51.960
kumain ka na ba

00:41:52.737 --> 00:41:55.115
Sige. Dalawa lang ang
klase ko ngayong hapon.

00:42:02.679 --> 00:42:05.599
Subukan ito. Pinausukang isda ni Shen.

00:42:06.115 --> 00:42:07.426
Mag-ingat ka. May mga buto.

00:42:08.360 --> 00:42:09.479
Nandito ang mga guro.

00:42:09.493 --> 00:42:10.982
Hindi ko gustong mag-alok sa kanila.

00:42:13.280 --> 00:42:13.999
Mabait?

00:42:16.280 --> 00:42:17.159
Ang sarap.

00:42:17.800 --> 00:42:18.559
Magsisimula na ako

00:42:18.559 --> 00:42:19.679
ang aking pangalawang plano sa negosyo.

00:42:20.599 --> 00:42:21.999
Nagdadala ako ng pinausukang isda ni Shen

00:42:21.999 --> 00:42:23.039
papunta sa canteen.

00:42:23.800 --> 00:42:25.079
Ngunit ang pinausukang isda ay may mga buto.

00:42:25.159 --> 00:42:26.479
Sayang naman kung may mabulunan.

00:42:27.159 --> 00:42:29.280
Iyan ay isang problema na kailangan nating ayusin.

00:42:31.280 --> 00:42:32.400
Maaari mong gamitin

00:42:33.479 --> 00:42:35.320
isda na walang buto.

00:42:35.320 --> 00:42:36.320
Isda na walang buto?

00:42:37.960 --> 00:42:40.039
Isda na walang buto...

00:42:41.280 --> 00:42:41.999
Isda sa kahoy?

00:42:55.100 --> 00:42:56.950
???Maingay ang mundo???

00:42:57.550 --> 00:42:59.930
???Paglingon ko,
malayong tanaw na???

00:43:01.350 --> 00:43:03.230
???Minsan hindi ko alam kung ano ang gagawin???

00:43:03.230 --> 00:43:05.310
???Ano ang dapat hawakan nang tahimik???

00:43:05.310 --> 00:43:08.260
???Tulad ng silent care???

00:43:10.120 --> 00:43:12.530
???Lumipas ang mga panahon???

00:43:12.530 --> 00:43:15.390
???Ang oras ay lumilipas???

00:43:15.880 --> 00:43:17.790
???Mukhang medyo naiintindihan ko na???

00:43:17.790 --> 00:43:19.570
???At pakawalan din ang ilang bagay???

00:43:19.570 --> 00:43:24.290
???Lahat ng mapait na lasa
ay ang diwa ng kabataan???

00:43:24.290 --> 00:43:27.780
???Isang mahabang liham ang nakasulat???

00:43:27.930 --> 00:43:31.410
???Marahan na nagpapalaganap ng pagmamahal???

00:43:31.610 --> 00:43:35.600
???Sa lahat ng tinidor sa kapalaran???

00:43:35.600 --> 00:43:41.230
???Loving all the moments
that deserve to be loved???

